WEBVTT

00:01:52.400 --> 00:01:57.190
Last time on Dragon Ball Z, Bulma made a shocking discovery.

00:01:57.190 --> 00:02:00.000
The maniacal Android 20 is none other than

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:01.740
