00:02:54.830 --> 00:02:58.080
to activate the fearsome androids 17 and 18.

00:02:58.080 --> 00:03:00.000
And unless our heroes can stop him,

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:17.100
could mean the end of the world.

00:03:17.100 --> 00:03:30.000
I can't believe my father is so stubborn and self-centered.

00:03:31.530 --> 00:03:39.730
